# Authority boundaries

Cursor is an execution surface.

Never collapse:
- institution == operator/system operator
- operator/system operator == runtime
- runtime == workload identity
- technical access == authority
- authentication == authority
- route == authority
- receipt == approval
- artifact existence == BUILD PASS
- repository location == canon

Before consequential writes, require explicit scope and authority evidence. Missing or ambiguous authority fails closed.
